      "side": 1,
      "message": "As far as I can tell, this procedure will work for every one of those sets once a STM32_DFU_BASE is defined for other chips of interest.\n\nAN2606 lists addresses for each one of these series of Bootloaders and the entrance requirements is described as the same for each. The only difference is the target addresses which are reported on table 155 of that document.\n\nThis is taking the stm32/system.c\u0027s system_pre_init() related to enabling the read and write access to the backup registers and applying it. This will be tested primarily with the STM32F072 and potentially with the STM32F446. I can remove the unused code paths if that\u0027s preferred.",
